title: Unstaging where nothing is staged (39 with an empty index, then 39 with only the replacement staged): a notice, index holds only the replacement
folders: git-changes
expect-file: git-changes/src/steps.rs :: let two = 2;\n    two\n\}\n[\s\S]*step_5\(\) -> u32 \{\n    5\n\}\n\nfn step_7[\s\S]*eleven\(\)
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3000
left changes
goto src/steps.rs
wait 1000
zoom 0.5
wait 600
part unstage src/steps.rs 39
wait 1500
mark nothing
wait 600
part stage src/steps.rs 6
wait 1500
part unstage src/steps.rs 39
wait 1500
mark end
wait 600
quit
